{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eI95bIkFu3PIMARwFYHWug","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:00.428374+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eI95bIkFu3PIMARwFYHWug","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdunxichKXLSaCgMnPWLTCpsdCftiaASpjlzBkjyLAXV1ZSxS9lP8bI7xg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibddQMW7oVJCGbEjdEVUo04nibxYevia7T5VKicfUTqXXnh6jDgMTbria2c1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibddAnTUjYNd2A0gaMf8ekicDUffo9OlUlUmdhlISEkvIfibIYEt4LAiaBbw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdceqq16PkxkuNNRZgA07Qiby2I3k5Fvib4PWcQWKa49FWuH2icPgEQQI1Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdWsL3H6HpgKUnIZHr6B083SGibWLQkzTm4tkuRWelznsk3d8O7tU9PTQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdFcEicyWfwvMlGDfMyxhZzB0p7f14mjP8RiciadRUlNN3aQLB3vSiaBNBoA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdak5DJP383PnUpYgwcxachHrLFFt2ySpMpvibMvtO948f8qW0l5v0FgQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibd49duE3IEkP24EibZic5JCibwicTtEvnXDpmWzamiajddXpG2424ZoIzdzEQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为了进一步提高培养质量，上海大学法学院李凤章教授团队于6月26日至6月27日，在上海大学法学院举办夏令营，具体通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>一、活动主题</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动主要聚焦在涉及资源能源行业的民法、行政法、刑法等相关理论以及英美法等相关内容。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>二、活动时间及方式</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span> 1.活动时间：2025年6月26日至27日</span></p><p><span> 2.活动地点：上海大学宝山校区（上海市宝山区南陈路333号）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>三、活动安排</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>第一天（6月26日）</span></strong></p><p><span>早上8点至12点 报到（报到地点：上海大学法学院1楼最东侧上海大学法学院公共法律服务中心办公室）</span></p><p><span>下午2点至3点 开班仪式</span></p><p><span>下午3点至5点 学术讲座</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>第二天（6月27日）</span></strong></p><p><span>上午8点至12点 学术讲座及交流活动</span></p><p><span>下午1点至4点 参观（钢铁行业实验室或生产基地等）</span></p><p><span>下午4点至5点 闭幕仪式</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>四、申请条件及方式</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）报名条件</span></strong></p><p><span> 1.品德优良、遵纪守法、本科阶段成绩优异；</span></p><p><span> 2.英语水平良好，具备较强的阅读、翻译及写作能力。</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）报名时间</span></strong></p><p><span>即日起至2025年6月22日18:00。</span></p><p><strong><span>（三）报名材料</span></strong></p><p><span>申请者需要准备以下电子材料，包括：</span></p><p><span>1.《上海大学法学院“资源能源涉外法治人才培养夏令营”申请表》（请扫描百度网盘链接获得申请表）</span></p><p><span>2.有效居民身份证正反面复印件和学信网近期下载的《教育部学籍在线验证报告》；</span></p><p><span>3.本科成绩单与总评成绩排名证明；</span></p><p><span>4.外语水平证明；</span></p><p><span>5.其他证明材料复印件（如已发表论文、其他获奖或资格证书）。</span></p><p><strong><span>（四）报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span>申请人应于2025年6月22日18:00前将申请材料扫描后打包以“姓名-就读学校-专业-夏令营”命名后用电子邮件发送至邮箱zggtxhlaw@163.com进行网上报名，以电子邮件发送时间为准，过期则申请无效。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>五、计划人数</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营活动计划招募15名学员。包括：已被上海大学录取的2025年秋季入学的专业硕士研究生（含非全）10人；其他学校学生5人。</span></p><p><span>本次审核录取工作将于6月23日结束，审核通过的学员名单将在“上海大学法学院公共法律服务中心”官方微信公众号公布，并直接通知学员本人（以电话或电子邮件形式）。届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>六、活动保障</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.学院不收取任何费用；</span></p><p><span>2.夏令营期间统一提供住宿（6月26日一晚双人间住宿）；</span></p><p><span>3.夏令营期间为营员提供6月26日中午、晚上以及6月27日早上、中午的用餐；</span></p><p><span><span>4.夏令营期间为每名营员购买保险；</span></span></p><p><span>其余费用自理。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>七、活动注意事项</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.报名学员须对填写内容的真实性负责，如填报虚假信息，一经核实，将取消学员资格；</span></p><p><span>2.学员须遵守我院相关规定，在营期间服从管理；</span></p><p><span>3.本次活动最终解释权归上海大学法学院所有。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdlNSicjlB09V3s4uolmp9IaKDBmpa2NS0gOiciaFST7QQWeIdJUa055AwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>八、联系方式</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.联系人：魏同学 于同学</span></p><p><span>2.咨询电话：18756123208 19370606785</span></p><p><span>3.邮箱：zggtxhlaw@163.com</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9E4PLHW3fwpNVba6TFt9h6R8GQbiaEAibdhJjojfxp4M9WtxMiadRiblw6f1pGv66AhvqfuiaxRPSQUYibB5as74Ffow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9E4PLHW3fwo6FiaYzuKsfxQsmf0qorwHNk4Qecf0s9chmeTSU3kMKMaPiaeiaOkTZJCC8WD1ibLNYj6ziaGbbJTlvBA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a55445bce147dc8013fa2afc3448a782f165c0ae2ff8f00da486d78231da872c","textLength":1127,"sourceSha256":"853fa97265f932ebb7147f7fb1182e73bb942f6f36a683ffe03cf26a2c143927","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5a2d2ab5ee52d64e7f13","title":"2025年上海大学法学院“资源能源涉外法治人才培养夏令营”招生简章公布","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:00.428374+00:00"}
